<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!--
  <lang>
    <zh-CN>在线能力包隔离暂存区：位于 App_Data 下且由本配置在 Web 服务器层拒绝一切 URL 直接访问。
    依据 OWASP File Upload Cheat Sheet「上传文件应存到 webroot 之外或不可直接服务的位置」「上传目录须在 Web 服务器层禁用
    per-directory 配置覆盖，防止上传 web.config 改变目录处理方式」。此处 fileExtensions 全部清空并 allowUnlisted=false，
    且 hiddenSegments 显式拒绝该目录，使隔离区内的任何文件都不能被请求、执行或用作配置覆盖；
    包内携带 .config 文件另由 PortalOnlinePackagePolicy 的条目类型白名单在落盘前拒绝（纵深防御）。
    本文件是部署产物，由版本库提供，不来自上传；任何后续安装都必须把文件搬离本目录后才可对外服务。</zh-CN>
    <en>Isolated staging area for online capability packages: located under App_Data and, through this config, denies all direct URL access at the web-server layer.
    Follows the OWASP File Upload Cheat Sheet ("store uploads outside the webroot or somewhere not directly retrievable" and "disable per-directory
    configuration overrides on upload directories at the web server level so an uploaded web.config cannot change directory handling").
    All file extensions are cleared with allowUnlisted=false and the directory is rejected as a hidden segment, so nothing inside can be requested,
    executed, or used as a configuration override. A .config carried inside a package is separately rejected before landing by the entry-type
    allow-list in PortalOnlinePackagePolicy (defence in depth). This file is a deployment artifact supplied by source control, never by an upload;
    any later installation must move files out of this directory before they can be served.</en>
  </lang>
-->
<configuration>
  <system.web>
    <!-- <lang>
      <zh-CN>拒绝所有用户访问该目录，包含已认证用户；隔离暂存区从不通过 HTTP 提供内容。</zh-CN>
      <en>Deny all users, including authenticated ones; the isolated staging area never serves content over HTTP.</en>
    </lang> -->
    <authorization>
      <deny users="*" />
    </authorization>
  </system.web>
  <system.webServer>
    <security>
      <requestFiltering>
        <!-- <lang>
          <zh-CN>清空全部允许扩展名并保持 allowUnlisted=false，等价于「此目录不服务任何文件类型」；
          applyToWebDAV=true 让 WebDAV 请求同样受约束；不依赖在线设置放宽。</zh-CN>
          <en>Clear every allowed extension and keep allowUnlisted=false, equivalent to "this directory serves no file type";
          applyToWebDAV=true extends the same constraint to WebDAV; no online setting may broaden it.</en>
        </lang> -->
        <fileExtensions allowUnlisted="false" applyToWebDAV="true">
          <clear />
        </fileExtensions>
        <!-- <lang>
          <zh-CN>显式把隔离暂存目录登记为隐藏段，作为扩展名过滤之外的第二层拒绝。</zh-CN>
          <en>Explicitly register the isolated staging directory as a hidden segment, a second denial layer beyond extension filtering.</en>
        </lang> -->
        <hiddenSegments>
          <add segment="OnlinePackages" />
        </hiddenSegments>
      </requestFiltering>
    </security>
  </system.webServer>
</configuration>
